+    [Container](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/named_req/Container)
+    requirements:
+    - The complexity is constant.
+    - Has the semantics of `begin() == end()`.
+
+    @sa @ref size() -- returns the number of elements
+
+    @since version 1.0.0
+    */
